


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_662f13ce:



    voice "RIN_0910"
    rin "「嗯～有件事要告诉大家」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_8628308e:


    "阳菜和文在锁教室的门的时候，伦迎面走了过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_cd5af91b:



    voice "HIN_0967"
    hina "「咦，你刚刚有离开过教室吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_4a7ae02d:



    voice "FUM_0807"
    fumi "「我们差点就把门锁上了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_50908e8c:



    voice "RIN_0911"
    rin "「我的存在感很低吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_45f5f2c3:



    voice "HIN_0968"
    hina "「不，只是觉得伦你不在教室的情况很罕见」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_b941a780:



    voice "FUM_0808"
    fumi "「毕竟平常会等夏目同学一起回去的嘛。说来有什么事情要告诉我们？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_a2a7fcd2:



    voice "FUM_0809"
    fumi "「毕竟平常会等阳菜一起回去的嘛。说来有什么事情要告诉我们？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_18b7a919:



    voice "RIN_0912"
    rin "「对了，我问了下生物的宫须老师」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_fee6ce8c:


    "听到她问了生物老师，两人还是一脸摸不着头脑的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_ed04b5f5:



    voice "RIN_0913"
    rin "「前两天那根羽毛的鉴定结果出来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_a9350ede:


    "伦从包里拿出了一个小塑料袋。里面封有那根羽毛。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_ea00a434:


    "两人恍然大悟。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_58952652:



    voice "RIN_0914"
    rin "「这根羽毛是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_48697e45:


    "阳菜和文都咽了下口水，等待伦说出结果。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_b115b588:



    voice "RIN_0915"
    rin "「是鹅毛。应该是你房间的羽毛被，或者是羽绒服里掉出来的吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_b3ae68a0:



    voice "FUM_0810"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_836af228:


    "视线都集中在了阳菜身上。"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_a85cb3ba:



    voice "HIN_0969"
    hina "「诶，我？」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_1b4a0f96:



    voice "FUM_0811"
    fumi "「确实有个小口子的对吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_0c0a0115:



    voice "HIN_0970"
    hina "「等等，羽绒服里怎么会有那么大的羽毛」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_a4eb7fba:



    voice "RIN_0916"
    rin "「便宜货里有时会有的嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_a54fa6d7:



    voice "HIN_0971"
    hina "「别用这种怜悯的眼神看着我」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_78302454:



    voice "FUM_0812"
    fumi "「嘛嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_9f395a1b:



    voice "RIN_0917"
    rin "「所以说犯人就是阳菜」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_b8730718:



    voice "HIN_0972"
    hina "「喂，别用犯人这个词啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_4e97770b:



    voice "FUM_0813"
    fumi "「唔」"




translate simplified_chinese a04_comn_01_6a47a4ff:


    "伦从包里拿出了一个小塑料袋。里面封有那根羽毛。"
